{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-6","storyName":"回声飘荡的大厅","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"祥子狼狈地回到梦城堡中，莫菲丝嘲笑祥子一次次的失败，Ave{@nbs}Mujica没有一个人想和她回到现实。莫菲丝表示自己为祥子准备了一个绝佳的梦境。祥子重新回到了执行罗德岛外勤任务时所乘坐的车里，本以为只是曾经的梦境的重演，却发现这次的梦境出现了偏差。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["丰川祥子","莫菲丝","祐天寺若麦","八幡海铃","“睦”","？？？","红豆","爱丽丝","贝娜","司机"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"寒风在耳边呼啸而过。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"下坠，越来越快。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"可深渊仍不见底。","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"charslot","id":15},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","id":16},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_lmstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":18},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我那些强人所难的要求，除了你还有其他鼓手能满足吗？","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你是我见过的，最努力的鼓手。","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你明明......只需要做你自己就好。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在各个组织间忙碌，却找不到一个真正的落脚点......这就是你想要的生活吗？","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你本不该承受这种痛苦......","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"海铃，和我一起离开吧。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我一定要找到你......","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华......","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦，这里不是现实，我们现在应该......","id":62},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"砰——！","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_land_impact","id":69},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":72},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"30","fadeout":"false","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——！","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"text","text":"急促的心跳，失控的呼吸，还有背脊上的冷汗。","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"知觉再次回到了祥子体内，却是以这种狼狈不堪的方式。","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"很真实吧？","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"从不知道多高的地方，向地面坠落。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"还有梦境破碎，被困在“无梦之境”又无法逃脱......感觉如何呢？","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"即使那些梦都是美梦，它们也不该继续下去。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"窥窃她们心里最脆弱的部分，再将它们不断编排演绎......","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我可不这么认为哦。","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"在你闯进她们的梦前，她们几乎就要忘记你，还有那个根本无足轻重的乐队了。","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica是我们的契约，她们把人生托付给了我——","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"在乎它的只有你一个人吧！","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"什么——！","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你不是都亲耳听见了吗？","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"她们一个个，全都拒绝了你。","id":109},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spiritwhoosh","volume":"0.6","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_lmstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$3","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我不要。这里的人爱着身为女演员的我。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我为了这些，拼尽了一切......结果你告诉我这些全是假的？","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$4","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"什么荒唐话，我不可能接受！","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$4","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"这里是我的梦境，只有我自己就好了！","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spiritwhoosh","volume":"0.6","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_bg_33_g2_srcalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"你怎么可能懂我？","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$3","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"这样的生活就很好......这样更适合我。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我不需要谁来拯救。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"也没有人能救我。","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spiritwhoosh","volume":"0.6","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"sea","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":154},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"stopsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","fadetime":"0.5","channel":"sea","id":156},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spiritwhoosh","volume":"0.6","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“睦”","text":"果然，小睦根本不需要祥子。","id":165},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈哈哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈！","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你所有狼狈、无助、可笑的时刻，我全都看在眼里。","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"虽然之前你毁了我造的梦境，但这样一来一回，咱们也算是扯平了。","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"另外还要谢谢你，在她们的梦里一次又一次穿梭......","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"帮我证明——我创造的梦境就是完美无缺、无可挑剔的。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"现在那个家伙也该承认，我才是梦城堡里最有天赋的人了。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那个家伙？","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你不是在梦里见过她吗？","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"穿着贵族小姐般华丽的衣服，嘴里说着一些老掉牙的客套话。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"待在她的身边，简直让人坐立难安。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝才是这里的主人，你不过是个冒牌货！","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"她说过，再美好的梦，最后也应该醒来——","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔——！","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"祥子只觉得自己的声带被凝住，无法发出任何的声音。","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我终于知道你为什么让我生厌了。","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你和她一样，从骨子里听不进别人的想法，嘴里也永远都是那些假大空的说辞。","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"说什么托付了人生，其实是不想自己被人舍弃吧。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我看过你的人生，不过就是大小姐落魄后的不甘和挣扎。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你的每一个举动，无非就是在欺骗和说服自己，并且不让其他人觉得你落魄。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你这个人自负自傲，自私自利，简直无可救药。","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你的乐队到底意味着什么？哼，只是一群人用所谓的契约互相束缚，自娱自乐罢了。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"现在她们都得到了幸福，自然就抛下你了。丰川祥子，你又是孤身一人了。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"既然你相信爱丽丝说的那些话，那好，我为你重新准备了一场好梦。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"它天衣无缝，就算你知道它是假的，你也不会愿意醒来。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你会和你的同伴们一样，沉溺其中，无法自拔。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔——！","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"想说话？那就让你说最后一句。","id":227},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"恶魔般的少女在空中比画了一个图案，仿佛解开了什么锁链。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我——","id":232},{"type":"dialog","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"锁链又被狠狠地拉紧。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈——","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"果然，你还是不说话的时候比较可爱！","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"莫菲丝一步步靠近挣扎的祥子，她伸出了右手，放在了祥子的脸颊上。","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"虚伪的公主啊，在你刚才漫游奇境时，我已经完全了解你了。","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你最渴望什么，你最需要什么，你最害怕什么。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"别担心，这一次的梦，一定是完美的美梦。你会无比清醒，可你绝对不会想苏醒过来的。","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"沉眠吧。高贵的、狡猾的、自私的，人偶少女。","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"祝你，好梦。","id":250},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"charslot","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"哐当，哐当。","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"祥子，祥子？","id":258},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯......嗯？","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_bg_46_g1_transporter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我不是你说的那样——","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"祥子失声叫了出来，可眼下她已不在城堡内，莫菲丝也消失得无影无踪。","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":273},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":274,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你还好吗？你脸色很难看，是不是又做噩梦了？","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我又......回到自己的梦里了。","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你在说什么胡话，你这不是刚醒过来吗？","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"是不是睡糊涂了？","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"爱丽丝和贝娜也在......","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"你好......我好像还没自我介绍过？","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"我们上车的时候，她好像已经睡着了？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我和红豆没有迟到......梦发生改变了......","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"祥子，你从刚才就一直在说一些奇怪的话——","id":291},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我们正在前往维多利亚的一个小镇，目的是去找一个和爱丽丝熟识的，名叫“安”的女孩。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":296},{"type":"subtitle","text":"而这辆载具会在不久后爆胎，我们要被迫停下修补轮胎，耽误数个小时......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":297},{"type":"subtitle","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我们，这是要去维多利亚找安吗？","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"安是谁？爱丽丝你认识吗？","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我也不认识。安是祥子小姐在小镇的朋友吗？","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸......？爱丽丝也不知道？","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那我和红豆......","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"这不是正好有派到你家附近的工作吗？我就想着让你也顺便回家休息休息，看望一下家人。","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"一直忙于工作，祥子你也很久没有回过家了吧。","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.6","id":317},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"怎么回事，车怎么突然停了？！","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"不会爆胎了吧？！","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司机","text":"呼......呼......呼......刚才差点撞上驮兽！","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司机","text":"好在有惊无险，我们马上重新上路！","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":328},{"type":"charslot","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"随着发动机重新运作的声音，窗外的风景再次移动了起来。","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"一模一样的荒原，一模一样的同行者。","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"可梦境，已然发生偏差。","id":340},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"image","id":345}],"characters":["丰川祥子","莫菲丝","祐天寺若麦","八幡海铃","“睦”","？？？","红豆","爱丽丝","贝娜","司机"]}